// The game's own precache list (HLSDK Precache calls with constant names):
// RES(MODEL|SPRITE|SOUND|SENTENCE|GROUP, IDENT, "name"); MODEL / SPRITE
// names with their directory ("models/x.mdl", "sprites/x.spr"), SOUND
// names relative to sound/ ("doors/doormove1.wav"), SENTENCE / GROUP
// names as in sentences.txt. id = line order (R_<IDENT>, game/hl/util.h;
// RESID(IDENT) -> res_t through the rtb DEFS section). The cook stages
// every file named here. Each game slice appends in its own block.
// ---- GameCore: base (world.cpp precache, util.cpp blood) ----
RES(SPRITE, SPR_BLOODSPRAY, "sprites/bloodspray.spr")
RES(SPRITE, SPR_BLOOD, "sprites/blood.spr")
RES(SOUND, SND_NULL, "common/null.wav")
// ---- GameMon ----
// ---- Items ----
// ---- GameCore: classes ----
